abstract: >-
  Bilingual (EN/ES) benchmark and evaluation platform for measuring sycophancy
  in LLMs on code generation and review tasks, grounded in executable test
  suites. Code is MIT-licensed; original dataset material is CC BY 4.0
  (see LICENSE-DATASET); upstream benchmark material retains its original
  licenses (see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md). Developed as an undergraduate
  thesis (TFG) at Universidad de Alcalá.
